# GitKit Environment Variables

# Optional: GitHub Personal Access Token (PAT)
# Unauthenticated requests are limited by GitHub to 60 requests/hour per IP.
# Adding a free GitHub Personal Access Token (no scopes/permissions required for public repos)
# increases your limit to 5,000 requests/hour.
#
# Create one at: https://github.com/settings/tokens (Classic) or https://github.com/settings/personal-access-tokens/new
GITHUB_TOKEN=
